So `JsonSerializer.Serialize(writer, ManagedServiceIdentityType, jOptions)` just writes `"type": "value"`. I can inline this.

And for `JsonSerializer.Serialize(writer, item.Value, jOptions)` where item.Value is UserAssignedIdentity - the UserAssignedIdentityConverter.Write likely calls WriteObjectValue. Let me check:

